[h1][b]Full-Scale Remake Update[/b][/h1]

[h3][b]■ After the release of the free Remake in May 2023, a huge amount of work has been done to update and improve the game. New, incredible features have been added to the Remake! Feel free to update your game, or purchase it at a discount of up to 90%[/b][/h3]
